<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  3.39 %		    C/S =  1.02 %</p>
<p>	   O/N =  3.82 %		    O/N =  Par</p>
<p>	   T/N =  3.82 %		    T/N =  1.91 %</p>
<p>		   April 11, 1997		    April 10, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.07 %     1 month forward =  4.07 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.92 %     2 month forward =  5.26 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.66 %     3 month forward =  5.88 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.03 %     4 month forward =  6.20 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.18 %     5 month forward =  6.38 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.19 %     6 month forward =  6.36 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
